Subject: [PATCH] basic: match counted_by annotation in Linux 6.18 UAPI

The SC2 target uses Linux 6.18.57 headers. systemd 255's vendored
src/basic/linux/stddef.h shadows the sysroot header and predates the
__counted_by annotation used by vhost_features_array.

Copy the userspace annotation definition from Linux 6.18.57's
include/uapi/linux/stddef.h. It has no effect on userspace layout and
matches the exported kernel contract; keep vmspawn and vhost declarations
intact instead of disabling consumers or defining compiler-wide macros.

---
diff --git a/src/basic/linux/stddef.h b/src/basic/linux/stddef.h
--- a/src/basic/linux/stddef.h
+++ b/src/basic/linux/stddef.h
@@ -43,4 +43,9 @@
 		struct { } __empty_ ## NAME; \
 		TYPE NAME[]; \
 	}
+
+#ifndef __counted_by
+#define __counted_by(m)
+#endif
+
 #endif
